    {
      "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneIII_4.3/p@98479",
      "type": "stage",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "scenedesc"
      ],
      "text": "Enter Touchstone and Audrey; Jaques at a distance observing them.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [
        {
          "tag": "span",
          "start": 6,
          "end": 16,
          "className": "charname"
        },
        {
          "tag": "span",
          "start": 21,
          "end": 35,
          "className": "charname"
        }
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneIII_4.3/p@98479/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 65,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 628854,
        "end": 629009,
        "line": 23585,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap04/p@98479",
        "anchor": "sceneIII_4.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": null,
      "attribution": {
        "status": "not-applicable"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneIII_4.3/p@98638",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "TOUCHSTONE.\nCome apace, good Audrey. I will fetch up your goats, Audrey. And how, Audrey? Am I the man yet? Doth my simple feature content you?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneIII_4.3/p@98638/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 11,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneIII_4.3/p@98638/line-2",
          "start": 12,
          "end": 143,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 629013,
        "end": 629187,
        "line": 23590,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap04/p@98638",
        "anchor": "sceneIII_4.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "TOUCHSTONE.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 11
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneIII_4.3/p@98816",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "AUDREY.\nYour features, Lord warrant us! What features?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneIII_4.3/p@98816/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 7,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneIII_4.3/p@98816/line-2",
          "start": 8,
          "end": 54,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 629191,
        "end": 629275,
        "line": 23596,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap04/p@98816",
        "anchor": "sceneIII_4.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "AUDREY.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneIII_4.3/p@98904",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "TOUCHSTONE.\nI am here with thee and thy goats, as the most capricious poet, honest Ovid, was among the Goths.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneIII_4.3/p@98904/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 11,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneIII_4.3/p@98904/line-2",
          "start": 12,
          "end": 109,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 629279,
        "end": 629419,
        "line": 23601,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap04/p@98904",
        "anchor": "sceneIII_4.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "TOUCHSTONE.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 11
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneIII_4.3/p@99048",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "JAQUES.\n[Aside.] O knowledge ill-inhabited, worse than Jove in a thatched house!",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [
        {
          "tag": "i",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 14
        }
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneIII_4.3/p@99048/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 7,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneIII_4.3/p@99048/line-2",
          "start": 8,
          "end": 80,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 629423,
        "end": 629540,
        "line": 23607,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap04/p@99048",
        "anchor": "sceneIII_4.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "JAQUES.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneIII_4.3/p@99169",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "TOUCHSTONE.\nWhen a man’s verses cannot be understood, nor a man’s good wit seconded with the forward child, understanding, it strikes a man more dead than a great reckoning in a little room. Truly, I would the gods had made thee poetical.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneIII_4.3/p@99169/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 11,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneIII_4.3/p@99169/line-2",
          "start": 12,
          "end": 238,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 629544,
        "end": 629814,
        "line": 23612,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap04/p@99169",
        "anchor": "sceneIII_4.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "TOUCHSTONE.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 11
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneIII_4.3/p@99443",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "AUDREY.\nI do not know what “poetical” is. Is it honest in deed and word? Is it a true thing?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneIII_4.3/p@99443/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 7,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneIII_4.3/p@99443/line-2",
          "start": 8,
          "end": 92,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 629818,
        "end": 629941,
        "line": 23619,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap04/p@99443",
        "anchor": "sceneIII_4.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "AUDREY.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneIII_4.3/p@99570",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "TOUCHSTONE.\nNo, truly; for the truest poetry is the most feigning, and lovers are given to poetry, and what they swear in poetry may be said, as lovers, they do feign.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneIII_4.3/p@99570/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 11,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneIII_4.3/p@99570/line-2",
          "start": 12,
          "end": 167,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 629945,
        "end": 630143,
        "line": 23625,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap04/p@99570",
        "anchor": "sceneIII_4.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "TOUCHSTONE.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 11
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneIII_4.3/p@99772",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "AUDREY.\nDo you wish, then, that the gods had made me poetical?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneIII_4.3/p@99772/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 7,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneIII_4.3/p@99772/line-2",
          "start": 8,
          "end": 62,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 630147,
        "end": 630239,
        "line": 23631,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap04/p@99772",
        "anchor": "sceneIII_4.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "AUDREY.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneIII_4.3/p@99868",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "TOUCHSTONE.\nI do, truly, for thou swear’st to me thou art honest. Now if thou wert a poet, I might have some hope thou didst feign.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneIII_4.3/p@99868/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 11,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneIII_4.3/p@99868/line-2",
          "start": 12,
          "end": 131,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 630243,
        "end": 630405,
        "line": 23636,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap04/p@99868",
        "anchor": "sceneIII_4.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "TOUCHSTONE.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 11
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneIII_4.3/p@100034",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "AUDREY.\nWould you not have me honest?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneIII_4.3/p@100034/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 7,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneIII_4.3/p@100034/line-2",
          "start": 8,
          "end": 37,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 630409,
        "end": 630476,
        "line": 23642,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap04/p@100034",
        "anchor": "sceneIII_4.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "AUDREY.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneIII_4.3/p@100105",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "TOUCHSTONE.\nNo, truly, unless thou wert hard-favoured; for honesty coupled to beauty is to have honey a sauce to sugar.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneIII_4.3/p@100105/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 11,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneIII_4.3/p@100105/line-2",
          "start": 12,
          "end": 119,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 630480,
        "end": 630630,
        "line": 23647,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap04/p@100105",
        "anchor": "sceneIII_4.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "TOUCHSTONE.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 11
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneIII_4.3/p@100259",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "JAQUES.\n[Aside.] A material fool!",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [
        {
          "tag": "i",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 14
        }
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneIII_4.3/p@100259/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 7,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneIII_4.3/p@100259/line-2",
          "start": 8,
          "end": 33,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 630634,
        "end": 630704,
        "line": 23653,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap04/p@100259",
        "anchor": "sceneIII_4.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "JAQUES.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneIII_4.3/p@100333",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "AUDREY.\nWell, I am not fair, and therefore I pray the gods make me honest.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneIII_4.3/p@100333/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 7,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneIII_4.3/p@100333/line-2",
          "start": 8,
          "end": 74,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 630708,
        "end": 630812,
        "line": 23658,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap04/p@100333",
        "anchor": "sceneIII_4.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "AUDREY.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneIII_4.3/p@100441",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "TOUCHSTONE.\nTruly, and to cast away honesty upon a foul slut were to put good meat into an unclean dish.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneIII_4.3/p@100441/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 11,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneIII_4.3/p@100441/line-2",
          "start": 12,
          "end": 104,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 630816,
        "end": 630951,
        "line": 23663,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap04/p@100441",
        "anchor": "sceneIII_4.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "TOUCHSTONE.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 11
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneIII_4.3/p@100580",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "AUDREY.\nI am not a slut, though I thank the gods I am foul.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneIII_4.3/p@100580/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 7,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneIII_4.3/p@100580/line-2",
          "start": 8,
          "end": 59,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 630955,
        "end": 631044,
        "line": 23669,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap04/p@100580",
        "anchor": "sceneIII_4.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "AUDREY.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneIII_4.3/p@100673",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "TOUCHSTONE.\nWell, praised be the gods for thy foulness; sluttishness may come hereafter. But be it as it may be, I will marry thee. And to that end I have been with Sir Oliver Martext, the vicar of the next village, who hath promised to meet me in this place of the forest and to couple us.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneIII_4.3/p@100673/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 11,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneIII_4.3/p@100673/line-2",
          "start": 12,
          "end": 290,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 631048,
        "end": 631371,
        "line": 23674,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap04/p@100673",
        "anchor": "sceneIII_4.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "TOUCHSTONE.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 11
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneIII_4.3/p@101000",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "JAQUES.\n[Aside.] I would fain see this meeting.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [
        {
          "tag": "i",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 14
        }
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneIII_4.3/p@101000/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 7,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneIII_4.3/p@101000/line-2",
          "start": 8,
          "end": 47,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 631375,
        "end": 631459,
        "line": 23682,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap04/p@101000",
        "anchor": "sceneIII_4.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "JAQUES.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneIII_4.3/p@101088",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "AUDREY.\nWell, the gods give us joy!",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneIII_4.3/p@101088/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 7,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneIII_4.3/p@101088/line-2",
          "start": 8,
          "end": 35,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 631463,
        "end": 631528,
        "line": 23687,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap04/p@101088",
        "anchor": "sceneIII_4.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "AUDREY.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneIII_4.3/p@101157",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "TOUCHSTONE.\nAmen. A man may, if he were of a fearful heart, stagger in this attempt, for here we have no temple but the wood, no assembly but horn-beasts. But what though? Courage! As horns are odious, they are necessary. It is said, “Many a man knows no end of his goods.” Right. Many a man has good horns and knows no end of them. Well, that is the dowry of his wife; ’tis none of his own getting. Horns? Even so. Poor men alone? No, no, the noblest deer hath them as huge as the rascal. Is the single man therefore blessed? No. As a walled town is more worthier than a village, so is the forehead of a married man more honourable than the bare brow of a bachelor. And by how much defence is better than no skill, by so much is horn more precious than to want.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneIII_4.3/p@101157/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 11,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneIII_4.3/p@101157/line-2",
          "start": 12,
          "end": 762,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 631532,
        "end": 632333,
        "line": 23692,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap04/p@101157",
        "anchor": "sceneIII_4.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "TOUCHSTONE.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 11
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneIII_4.3/p@101962",
      "type": "stage",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "scenedesc"
      ],
      "text": "Enter Sir Oliver Martext.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [
        {
          "tag": "span",
          "start": 6,
          "end": 24,
          "className": "charname"
        }
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneIII_4.3/p@101962/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 25,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 632337,
        "end": 632417,
        "line": 23706,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap04/p@101962",
        "anchor": "sceneIII_4.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": null,
      "attribution": {
        "status": "not-applicable"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneIII_4.3/p@102046",
      "type": "passage",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "Here comes Sir Oliver. Sir Oliver Martext, you are well met. Will you dispatch us here under this tree, or shall we go with you to your chapel?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneIII_4.3/p@102046/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 143,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 632421,
        "end": 632590,
        "line": 23708,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap04/p@102046",
        "anchor": "sceneIII_4.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": null,
      "attribution": {
        "status": "source-unlabelled"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneIII_4.3/p@102219",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "MARTEXT.\nIs there none here to give the woman?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneIII_4.3/p@102219/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 8,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneIII_4.3/p@102219/line-2",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 46,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 632594,
        "end": 632670,
        "line": 23713,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap04/p@102219",
        "anchor": "sceneIII_4.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "MARTEXT.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneIII_4.3/p@102299",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "TOUCHSTONE.\nI will not take her on gift of any man.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneIII_4.3/p@102299/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 11,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneIII_4.3/p@102299/line-2",
          "start": 12,
          "end": 51,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 632674,
        "end": 632755,
        "line": 23718,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap04/p@102299",
        "anchor": "sceneIII_4.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "TOUCHSTONE.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 11
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneIII_4.3/p@102384",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "MARTEXT.\nTruly, she must be given, or the marriage is not lawful.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneIII_4.3/p@102384/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 8,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneIII_4.3/p@102384/line-2",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 65,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 632759,
        "end": 632854,
        "line": 23723,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap04/p@102384",
        "anchor": "sceneIII_4.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "MARTEXT.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneIII_4.3/p@102483",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "JAQUES.\n[Coming forward.] Proceed, proceed. I’ll give her.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [
        {
          "tag": "i",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 23
        }
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneIII_4.3/p@102483/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 7,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneIII_4.3/p@102483/line-2",
          "start": 8,
          "end": 58,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 632858,
        "end": 632953,
        "line": 23728,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap04/p@102483",
        "anchor": "sceneIII_4.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "JAQUES.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneIII_4.3/p@102582",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "TOUCHSTONE.\nGood even, good Master What-ye-call’t, how do you, sir? You are very well met. God ’ild you for your last company. I am very glad to see you. Even a toy in hand here, sir. Nay, pray be covered.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneIII_4.3/p@102582/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 11,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneIII_4.3/p@102582/line-2",
          "start": 12,
          "end": 205,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 632957,
        "end": 633194,
        "line": 23733,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap04/p@102582",
        "anchor": "sceneIII_4.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "TOUCHSTONE.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 11
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneIII_4.3/p@102823",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "JAQUES.\nWill you be married, motley?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneIII_4.3/p@102823/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 7,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneIII_4.3/p@102823/line-2",
          "start": 8,
          "end": 36,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 633198,
        "end": 633264,
        "line": 23740,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap04/p@102823",
        "anchor": "sceneIII_4.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "JAQUES.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneIII_4.3/p@102893",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "TOUCHSTONE.\nAs the ox hath his bow, sir, the horse his curb, and the falcon her bells, so man hath his desires; and as pigeons bill, so wedlock would be nibbling.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneIII_4.3/p@102893/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 11,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneIII_4.3/p@102893/line-2",
          "start": 12,
          "end": 162,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 633268,
        "end": 633461,
        "line": 23745,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap04/p@102893",
        "anchor": "sceneIII_4.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "TOUCHSTONE.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 11
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneIII_4.3/p@103090",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "JAQUES.\nAnd will you, being a man of your breeding, be married under a bush like a beggar? Get you to church, and have a good priest that can tell you what marriage is. This fellow will but join you together as they join wainscot; then one of you will prove a shrunk panel, and like green timber, warp, warp.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneIII_4.3/p@103090/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 7,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneIII_4.3/p@103090/line-2",
          "start": 8,
          "end": 308,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 633465,
        "end": 633806,
        "line": 23751,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap04/p@103090",
        "anchor": "sceneIII_4.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "JAQUES.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneIII_4.3/p@103435",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "TOUCHSTONE.\n[Aside.] I am not in the mind but I were better to be married of him than of another, for he is not like to marry me well, and not being well married, it will be a good excuse for me hereafter to leave my wife.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [
        {
          "tag": "i",
          "start": 13,
          "end": 18
        }
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneIII_4.3/p@103435/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 11,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneIII_4.3/p@103435/line-2",
          "start": 12,
          "end": 222,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 633810,
        "end": 634071,
        "line": 23759,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap04/p@103435",
        "anchor": "sceneIII_4.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "TOUCHSTONE.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 11
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneIII_4.3/p@103700",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "JAQUES.\nGo thou with me, and let me counsel thee.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneIII_4.3/p@103700/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 7,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneIII_4.3/p@103700/line-2",
          "start": 8,
          "end": 49,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 634075,
        "end": 634154,
        "line": 23766,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap04/p@103700",
        "anchor": "sceneIII_4.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "JAQUES.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneIII_4.3/p@103783",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "TOUCHSTONE.\nCome, sweet Audrey. We must be married, or we must live in bawdry.\nFarewell, good Master Oliver. Not\n             O sweet Oliver,\n             O brave Oliver,\n         Leave me not behind thee.\nBut\n             Wind away,—\n             Begone, I say,\n         I will not to wedding with thee.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [
        {
          "tag": "i",
          "start": 126,
          "end": 205
        },
        {
          "tag": "i",
          "start": 223,
          "end": 304
        }
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
